        <item>
            <title>0.2.0</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v0.2.0</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Reorganized the dashboard into focused Overview, Projects, Models, and Usage &amp; Billing views with clearer navigation and controls.</li>
                    <li>Added project session graphs and structured workflow inspection for exploring how sessions and related activity connect.</li>
                    <li>Added richer daily usage details and paginated billing history, with smoother chart interactions and lower rendering overhead.</li>
                    <li>Improved menu-bar quota presentation and subscription-provider reliability, including refreshed Sub2API sessions and preserved validated credentials.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
